    },
    {
      "id": "Vqb3XAjYeIuRyP4nHW-N0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 461.06635220019507,
      "y": 543.9949508603515,
      "width": 744.699462890625,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0Q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1323367192,
      "version": 3269,
      "versionNonce": 747606510,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791535653568,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NOTES\n\n- One thread per C element.\n- Its row picks the row of A; its col picks the col of B.\n- It reads N Values from each and writes ONE element of C.\n\n- A and B are both stored row-major (row after row).\n- Walking along a row of A: each step is next slot in memory ->\nstride 1 (memory 4,5,6,7).\n- Walking down a column of B: each step skips a whole row of\nslots -> stride width (memory 2, 6, 10, 14).\n- Same storage, same formula. Only the direction of travel differs.\n\n- No C element depends on another, so all of them can be computed at once.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NOTES\n\n- One thread per C element.\n- Its row picks the row of A; its col picks the col of B.\n- It reads N Values from each and writes ONE element of C.\n\n- A and B are both stored row-major (row after row).\n- Walking along a row of A: each step is next slot in memory ->\nstride 1 (memory 4,5,6,7).\n- Walking down a column of B: each step skips a whole row of\nslots -> stride width (memory 2, 6, 10, 14).\n- Same storage, same formula. Only the direction of travel differs.\n\n- No C element depends on another, so all of them can be computed at once.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
